  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 발열 반응 관찰하기 실험입니다!<br>발열제에서 산화 칼슘을 빼서 물과 반응시키고,<br>그거를 수온 센서 막대로 섞으면서 온도 변화를 보는 겁니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c91b7e379b2f6c1691205d8cbcd84400cf22ceb6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c91b7e379b2f6c1691205d8cbcd84400cf22ceb6\" data-origin-width=\"890\" data-origin-height=\"1287\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92839da69eb62265107460f22323dfdaedcab46f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92839da69eb62265107460f22323dfdaedcab46f\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1286\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아이디어 자체는 김정식 수석님 블로그를 보고 참고 했습니다!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ff94c441933403573d4ec974ed262a9b88b5f2f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0ff94c441933403573d4ec974ed262a9b88b5f2f\" data-origin-width=\"902\" data-origin-height=\"1284\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1372ea87cee5103c6d71d7491210916951ff7546\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1372ea87cee5103c6d71d7491210916951ff7546\" data-origin-width=\"896\" data-origin-height=\"1283\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">선생님들도 꼭 해보고 후기 남겨주세요!!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div cla